+The compile needs Docker + Emscripten (multi-GB, long); everything needed to reproduce it is pinned here.
 
 ## Pin
 - RDKit tag: **`Release_2026_03_3`**
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ needed to reproduce it is pinned here.
